{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21064","headline":"勿执古寄韩潮州 · 刘叉","name":"勿执古寄韩潮州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古人皆执古，不辞[冻]饿悲。\n今人亦执古，自取行坐危。\n老菊凌霜葩，狞松抱雪姿。\n武王亦至明，宁哀首阳饥。\n仲尼岂非圣，但爲互乡嗤。\n寸心生万路，今古棼若丝。\n逐逐行不尽，茫茫休者谁。\n来恨不可遏，去悔何足追。\n玉石共笑唾，驽骥相奔驰。\n请君勿执古，执古徒自隳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘叉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21064.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21064","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}